    "description": "Sekisui Jushi Corporation provides various products and services through the application of composite technology in Japan. The company offers soundproofing materials; traffic safety products; electronic system-related products; road marking materials; road signs; and pedestrian and vehicle guardrails, snow and windbreak fences, wheel stops, prefabricated walkways, railings, park materials, shelters, solar lighting, artificial wood, etc. It also provides artificial turf, artificial turf field watering system, artificial turf field high-speed drainage system, temporary traffic safety products, heat-shielding pavement, concrete spalling prevention systems, signs, billboards, etc. In addition, the company offers mesh and vertical lattice fence, privacy and soundproof privacy walls, bicycle parking areas, and handrail products; packaging and binding bands and films, packaging materials, packaging machinery, safety fences, RFID-related products, agricultural materials, greenhouse horticultural materials, wildlife damage control products, aluminum-resin laminated composite panels, decorative building materials, assembly pipe systems, digital picking systems, automotive parts and related products, etc. Sekisui Jushi Corporation was incorporated in 1941 and is headquartered in Kita, Japan."
